:Class Counter
⍝ .aplc: a self-contained class (no interface needed), so it can be
⍝ loaded on its own:  dyalog Counter.aplc
⍝   c←⎕NEW Counter ⋄ c.Add 5 ⋄ c.Add 2 ⋄ c.Total   →   7
    :Field Public Total←0
    :Field Public Shared Created←0      ⍝ one value shared by all Counters

    ∇ make
      :Access Public
      :Implements Constructor
      Created+←1
    ∇

    ∇ Add n
      :Access Public
      Total+←n
    ∇

    ∇ Run
    ⍝ A public shared Run is called when the file is loaded at startup
      :Access Public Shared
      c←⎕NEW ⎕THIS                       ⍝ inside a shared method, ⎕THIS is the class
      c.Add¨3 4 5
      ⎕←'Counter demo: added 3 4 5, total = ',⍕c.Total
      ⎕←'Counters created so far: ',⍕Created
    ∇
:EndClass
